an class="cty-n">Juan Núñez I de Lara</span><span class="cty-y">d. 1294</span></span></a><span class="cty-track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="cty-bar pp-dim" style="left:98.5%;width:0.8%"></span></span></li></ol><figcaption>5 people of the encyclopedia whose Wikidata record names this house as their family. Bright bars are lifespans; pale bars reigns or years of activity.</figcaption></figure><h3 class="ft-h" id="family-tree">Family tree</h3><div class="ft-wrap" tabindex="0"><svg class="ft-svg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="444" height="148" viewBox="0 0 444 148" role="group" aria-label="Family tree: House of Lara"><path class="ft-w" d="M256 94V102"/><path class="ft-l" d="M202 74H222V26H242"/><path class="ft-l" d="M202 74H222V74H242"/><a href="/encyclopedia/muniadona-of-castile" class="ft-p" aria-label="Muniadona of Castile, c. 995–1066"><title>Muniadona of Castile (c. 995–1066)</title><rect x="242" y="6" width="196" height="40" rx="5"/><text class="ft-n" x="251" y="22">Muniadona of Castile</text><text class="ft-d" x="251" y="37">c. 995–1066</text></a><a href="/encyclopedia/garcia-sanchez-of-castile" class="ft-p ft-m" aria-label="García Sánchez of Castile, 1009–1029"><title>García Sánchez of Castile (1009–1029)</title><rect x="242" y="54" width="196" height="40" rx="5"/><text class="ft-n" x="251" y="70">García Sánchez of Castile</text><text class="ft-d" x="251" y="85">1009–1029</text></a><a href="/encyclopedia/sancha-of-leon" class="ft-p" aria-label="Sancha of León, c. 1018–1067"><title>Sancha of León (c. 1018–1067)</title><rect x="242" y="102" width="196" height="40" rx="5"/><text class="ft-n" x="251" y="118">Sancha of León</text><text class="ft-d" x="251" y="133">c. 1018–1067</text></a><a href="/encyclopedia/sancho-garcia-of-castile" class="ft-p ft-m" aria-label="Sancho García of Castile, d. 1017"><title>Sancho García of Castile (d. 1017)</title><rect x="6" y="54" width="196" height="40" rx="5"/><text class="ft-n" x="15" y="70">Sancho García of Castile</text><text class="ft-d" x="15" y="85">d. 1017</text></a></svg></div><p class="ft-note">4 people joined by the parents, spouses and children their Wikidata records name, the generations from left to right. A gold frame marks a member of the house; a short bar joins a husband or wife. It shows the people the encyclopedia holds, not the whole family.</p><p class="enc-article-foot"><a class="enc-random-link" href="/encyclopedia/dynasties">All ruling houses &rarr;</a></p></section>
